cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use twas-xcal, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "twas-xcal: ancestry-aware null calibration for transcriptome-wide association studies"
abstract: >-
  XCAL and XCAL-t provide ancestry-aware null calibration for TWAS tests under
  polygenic architectures, with a reproducible multi-ancestry TWAS null simulator.
  Validated in simulation and on 12,453 MESA expression models across 2,490
  1000 Genomes genomes from five ancestries.
